    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make poker game great again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple game rules, you only need one game to get started, you only need to choose one of &quot;Skip&quot;, &quot;Battle 1&quot;, &quot;Battle 2&quot;, &quot;Battle 3&quot;, and then wait for the settlement to give points to your opponent or yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601150/extras/0b544eb11e086b5d37b228ed27ca4440.avif?t=1749637673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play against online friends to see who is the &quot;head-to-head&quot; king</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a room, invite friends, or join a room directly to play customized battles with other players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601150/extras/53e2655aceb3a43d24b1df87f6c397c7.avif?t=1749637673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranked and Tournament</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in online matching to get a higher ranking, or... do you want to win the diamonds from them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601150/extras/31dfa040e6b144bc118701ea5618cd42.avif?t=1749637673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make poker game great again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple game rules, you only need one game to get started, you only need to choose one of &quot;Skip&quot;, &quot;Battle 1&quot;, &quot;Battle 2&quot;, &quot;Battle 3&quot;, and then wait for the settlement to give points to your opponent or yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601150/extras/0b544eb11e086b5d37b228ed27ca4440.avif?t=1749637673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play against online friends to see who is the &quot;head-to-head&quot; king</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a room, invite friends, or join a room directly to play customized battles with other players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601150/extras/53e2655aceb3a43d24b1df87f6c397c7.avif?t=1749637673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranked and Tournament</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in online matching to get a higher ranking, or... do you want to win the diamonds from them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601150/extras/31dfa040e6b144bc118701ea5618cd42.avif?t=1749637673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A simple and interesting new poker game that supports 2-4 players online battles. The key to winning is to balance risks and benefits, perform operations to maximize benefits, participate in ranking and bidding competitions, and see who is the real &quot;head-breaking&quot; king!",
